      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-muted dark:text-muted-dark leading-relaxed" data-i18n="sponsorship.subtitle">Krewire measures success by what developers build with it, not by money raised. Support, financial or not, is how the project stays maintained: it pays for maintainer time and infrastructure so that the open-source core keeps working for everyone.</p>
