            <li data-i18n-html="boost.item3_html"><b class="text-fg dark:text-fg-dark">Transparent Pair Programming:</b> AI agents explain architectural decisions openly in discussions and PR comments.</li>
            <li data-i18n-html="boost.item4_html"><b class="text-fg dark:text-fg-dark">Human Governance:</b> Ultimate merging authority always remains in the hands of human collective maintainers.</li>
          </ul>
